    "h1_note": "15:05Z run. Deepest Base pool Aerodrome DEUS/VIRTUAL liq $682,862.70 (was $681,813.53 at 14:05Z, +0.15%), mark $0.01787 vs prior $0.01768 -> +1.06%. h1 MEASURED +1.06%, h6 +2.76%, h24 -0.50%. VOLUME REVERSED THE COLLAPSE: 1h volume $5,587.05 vs $163.38 at 14:05Z = 34x, 6h $9,647.58, 24h $21,841.22 (was $16,803.34) - 24h total now ~5x the 10-22 pace. 1h tape 4 buy / 18 sell counts but NOT by dollars: since 14:50Z buys were $4,326.43 vs sells $1,245.11 (74/26 size split). THE BUYER IS NEW AND RETAINED: 0x259f962e77262ee8d97cc6a112d0e0321323ea0d took 255,416.2967 DEUS for $4,564.29 across 5 txs in 90 seconds (14:55:03Z $240.34 in USDC pool 0x58dba34e + 14:55:27Z $1,419.87 / 14:56:17Z $1,180.84 / 14:56:41Z $780.15 / 14:56:57Z $945.57 in VIRTUAL pool 0x3e97c5ec, blocks 0x3288c32-0x3288c6b), and balanceOf(DEUS) at block 0x3288cfc reads 255,416.296698 - matches the inbound sum TO THE WEI. Directional topic scan blocks 0x3288915-0x3288cfc: 5 inbound DEUS logs from pools, ZERO outbound. NOT the two-leg arb shape: no same-second opposite leg in any other pool, no forwarding. Wallet carries EIP-7702 delegation (eth_getCode returns 0xef010063c0c19a282a1b52b07dd5a65b58948a07dae32b, delegate is a smart-account implementation exposing 0x84b0196e/0xd03c7914/0xd691c964/0xf23a6e61/0xffa1ad74) - a smart account, not a throwaway bot EOA. ETH 0.819465, nonce 0x87 (135) - an established wallet newly pointed at DEUS. THIS IS THE SECOND DIRECTIONAL WALLET the operator has been waiting for; the prior one (0xa2f42a10...) still holds 113,627.090929296275135130 DEUS unchanged, ETH 0.00004395, nonce 0x4. The 18 sells are market-maker bots, not holders exiting: 0x96949fd549d0da5ca279662264085a93138bdb17 sold 12 clips of ~$49 (nonce 0x394c) and still holds 19,360.7865 DEUS ($346); 0x6abea4998f9ef34ee1cda5715ccca0e4d4efb730 sold ~$78-$194 clips (nonce 0x3efad = 257,965) and holds 0. Escrow DEUS balance 29,408,223.901 - UNCHANGED to the wei vs 14:05Z and only +5,127 / +0.017% vs 10-